{"story":{"id":"story-6bea8321f5b884f0","title":{"zh":"来自星系中心的信号","en":"Signal from the Center of the Galaxy"},"category":"stories","image":"art/46052217f1cfbadf6edf.webp","start":"central.5","chapters":3,"nodes":5,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"一个强大的信号从通常被认为是没有生命的星系中心发出，传向星系。没过多久，我们又收到了来自同一地点的信号传输。","en":"A powerful signal is bounced through the galaxy from the center, a place often thought to be empty of life. Shortly afterwards, we received a transmission from the very same location."},"navigation":{"order":["central.5","central.10","central.15"],"tree":[{"id":"central.5","parent":null,"depth":0,"kind":"reading","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"central.10","parent":"central.5","depth":1,"kind":"event","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"id":"central.15","parent":"central.10","depth":2,"kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"你好，呃……","en":"Hello the-"}}],"links":[{"from":"central.5","to":"central.10","kind":"event","label":{"zh":"","en":""}},{"from":"central.10","to":"central.15","kind":"choice","label":{"zh":"你好，呃……","en":"Hello the-"}}]}},"chapters":[{"id":"central.5","title":{"zh":"来自星系中心的信号","en":"Signal from the Center of the Galaxy"},"texts":[{"zh":"一个强大的信号从通常被认为是没有生命的星系中心发出，传向星系。没过多久，我们又收到了来自同一地点的信号传输。","en":"A powerful signal is bounced through the galaxy from the center, a place often thought to be empty of life. Shortly afterwards, we received a transmission from the very same location."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":"art/46052217f1cfbadf6edf.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"把它们接上来。","en":"Put them through."},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[{"target":"central.10","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-6bea8321f5b884f0"}],"readings":[]},{"id":"central.10","title":{"zh":"信号传输接入","en":"Incoming Transmission"},"texts":[{"zh":"你好，星系的年轻人。\n\n我们这些来自天堂中心的人再次离开了我们的庇护所，去看看你们这些住在外围的人必须为我们提供什么。希望你不会像在你之前的人那样试图给国家带来恐怖。","en":"Hail, you who are still young and new to the galaxy.\n\nWe who come from the paradise of the center have once more left our sanctuary to see what you who live on the outer circles have to offer. Hopefully, you will not try to bring terror upon the empire like those who came before you."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"外星渣滓。","en":"Xeno scum."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"猎物……","en":"Prey..."},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"<<侦测到有机生命。通讯终止。>>","en":"<< Organics identified. Communications terminated. >>"},"conditional":true,"next":[]},{"label":{"zh":"你好，呃……","en":"Hello the-"},"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"central.15","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-6bea8321f5b884f0"}]}],"next":[],"readings":[{"label":{"zh":"通常","en":"Default"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[]},{"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[0]},{"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[1]},{"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[2]},{"label":{"zh":"其他文明","en":"Other civilizations"},"textIndices":[0],"choiceIndices":[3]}]},{"id":"central.15","title":{"zh":"信号传输接入","en":"Incoming Transmission"},"texts":[{"zh":"…………","en":"..........."}],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"label":{"zh":"他们是切断了转播吗？","en":"Did they just cut the feed?"},"conditional":false,"next":[]}],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"central.1","title":{"zh":"","en":""},"texts":[],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":true,"choices":[],"next":[],"readings":[]},{"id":"central.2","title":{"zh":"","en":""},"texts":[],"variants":false,"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":true,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"central.5","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"kind":"event","story":"story-6bea8321f5b884f0"}],"readings":[]}]}